      "title": {
        "en": "Butelka wody"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "After a word for a container or an amount, the thing in it is in the genitive, as after *nie*: *butelka wody* (a bottle of water), *puszka coli*, *słoik dżemu*, *karton soku*, *pudełko czekoladek* (a box of chocolates). A *kostka* is a block: *kostka masła*. A *tabliczka* is a bar: *tabliczka czekolady*."
      }
    }
  ],
